{"id": "De8mEDavJu2", "title": "Video by index.opensource", "description": "Twine \u2014 turn linked passages into a playable story.\n\nIn our lighthouse story, bringing tea raises trust. Later, that choice decides whether the keeper shares a secret.\n\n\u2460 Publish to File \u2192 one HTML file you can play in a browser or host on itch.io.\n\u2461 Export as Twee \u2192 plain text that a game engine can read with a suitable parser.\n\nWe ran our story in Twine 2.12.1 and Godot 4.3. The Godot parser was written for this episode: it supports only the passages, links and Harlowe macros used here. It is not an official integration or a general Harlowe runtime.\n\nWhat earlier choice would you let a character remember?\n\nTwine \u2014 \uc5f0\uacb0\ud55c \ub2e8\ub77d\uc744 \ud50c\ub808\uc774\ud560 \uc218 \uc788\ub294 \uc774\uc57c\uae30\ub85c \ub9cc\ub4ed\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n\uc9c1\uc811 \ub9cc\ub4e0 \ub4f1\ub300\uc9c0\uae30 \uc774\uc57c\uae30\uc5d0\uc11c \ucc28\ub97c \uac74\ub124\uba74 \uc2e0\ub8b0\uac00 \uc62c\ub77c\uac00\uc694. \ub098\uc911\uc5d0 \ub4f1\ub300\uc9c0\uae30\uac00 \ube44\ubc00\uc744 \uc54c\ub824 \uc904\uc9c0\ub294 \uadf8 \uc120\ud0dd\uc5d0 \ub2ec\ub824 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n\u2460 Publish to File \u2192 \ube0c\ub77c\uc6b0\uc800\uc5d0\uc11c \uc5f4\uac70\ub098 itch.io\uc5d0 \uc62c\ub9b4 \uc218 \uc788\ub294 HTML \ud30c\uc77c \ud55c \uc7a5.\n\u2461 Export as Twee \u2192 \uc54c\ub9de\uc740 \ud30c\uc11c\ub97c \ud1b5\ud574 \uac8c\uc784 \uc5d4\uc9c4\uc5d0\uc11c \uc77d\uc744 \uc218 \uc788\ub294 \ud14d\uc2a4\ud2b8.\n\n\uac19\uc740 \uc774\uc57c\uae30\ub97c Twine 2.12.1\uacfc Godot 4.3\uc5d0\uc11c \uc2e4\ud589\ud588\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. Godot \ud30c\uc11c\ub294 \uc774 \ud3b8\uc744 \uc704\ud574 \uc791\uc131\ud588\uc73c\uba70 \uc5ec\uae30 \uc4f0\uc778 \ub2e8\ub77d\u00b7\ub9c1\ud06c\u00b7Harlowe \ub9e4\ud06c\ub85c\ub9cc \ucc98\ub9ac\ud574\uc694. \uacf5\uc2dd \uc5f0\ub3d9\uc774\ub098 \ubc94\uc6a9 Harlowe \uc2e4\ud589\uae30\ub294 \uc544\ub2d9\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n\uce90\ub9ad\ud130\uac00 \uc5b4\ub5a4 \uc774\uc804 \uc120\ud0dd\uc744 \uae30\uc5b5\ud558\uac8c \ub9cc\ub4e4\uace0 \uc2f6\uc73c\uc2e0\uac00\uc694?\n\nTwine: Chris Klimas & contributors \u00b7 GPL-3.0\nHarlowe 3.3.9: Leon Arnott \u00b7 Zlib / Godot 4.3: contributors \u00b7 MIT\nStory & Godot example / \uc774\uc57c\uae30\u00b7Godot \uc608\uc81c: our own / \uc9c1\uc811 \uc81c\uc791\nCurated by @hyun2xyz", "channel": "index.opensource", "uploader_id": "60040254965", "uploader": "index.opensource", "timestamp": 1792994636, "like_count": 753, "comment_count": 8, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1123430466730572a", "manifest_url": null, "ext": "m4a", "width": null, "height": null, "tbr": 53.337, "asr": 48000, "fps": null, "language": null, "format_note": "DASH audio", "filesize": null, "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "dynamic_range": null, "url": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNxJ1QlUYn9Na8w6NzFRXgZ7IjIp5DafJEUPRIZfNh-9udckx8cyXOSvMiroNavQMbrJhcA_ySkl8ckPq8PdhgmCvjoFjNl52B42NY.mp4?_nc_cat=104&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=07JG2Q5kGkEQ7kNvwHEKLlg&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=iBql8yspeFl-1YF1huHmSg&_nc_ss=79689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQRnVDjdHjfZt6zeJxjJ9CHfNPleT9qlTIAVVA6Cmlwog&oe=6AE4B095", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 53.337, "resolution": "audio only", "aspect_ratio": null, "filesize_approx": null, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+x